<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZOG Jun qtr oil gas sales NZ$5.7 mln.</title>
<headline>NZOG Jun qtr oil gas sales NZ$5.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand Oil and Gas Ltd said on Friday  it had lifted its sales receipts from oil and gas production for the  June quarter to NZ$5.7 million, up $2.3 million on the previous quarter.</p>
</text>
